<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Oct 3.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Oct 3.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at the close  was 3195.96, 31.03 points or 0.96 percent lower than Tuesday's close.</p>
